      "statement": "The consentsGate rule's condition is five clauses: @authenticated, not path-prefix('/auth'), not path-prefix('/token'), an exemption for the PATCH acceptance endpoint (method PATCH, path-template('/users/{userId}'), bson-request-whitelist(consents)), and not (A and B) on the latestConsents versions so a user missing either document is blocked.",
